# Allowlist: Python images need only these. Datasets, models, storage, secrets,
# backend/web sources and Git metadata never enter the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!specs/contracts/
!tests/
# Tiny fictional JSON examples consumed by the shared-schema tests only.
!docs/design/v1/examples/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
